			</div>
			<div class="profile-footer__links">
				<a href="/friends/">认识友链 <Icon is:inline name="material-symbols:arrow-right-alt-rounded" aria-hidden="true" /></a>
				<a href="/moments/">看看朋友圈 <Icon is:inline name="material-symbols:arrow-right-alt-rounded" aria-hidden="true" /></a>
			</div>
		</footer>
